    {
      "en": "label day72:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux1.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Gym class has ended for the day and I’m staying after with Ami to help clean the place up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Normally, this would be the part where all of the girls run off to the showers, but a certain incident today has prompted me to select at least one person to clean brain matter off of the floor.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And what better person to collect brain matter than my niece?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now, I'm sure you're looking for an explanation...and I will give you one. But whether you decide to believe it or not is up to you.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "While dropping by the gym to get something out of the storage room, one of the[school]’s janitors was pelted in the head by a dodgeball.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Normally, a grown man would be able to shrug something like this off and just get on with his day after a minute or two.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "However-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This particular dodgeball had been moving at the speed of a major league player’s fastball.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And while I'd like to say the janitor died on impact, he writhed in pain for a full five minutes or so before going silent.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There was blood everywhere.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And of course I had to be the one to clean it up on account of us now being down one janitor.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux2.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's crazy that this isn't even the first time something like this has happened, huh?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's not?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. This is like the third janitor Ayane has accidentally killed this year.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How does she have that much arm strength? And why hasn't she been put in jail yet?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't know. She's rich, so that probably has something to do with it.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fair enough.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux3.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, where should I be putting all of these mats?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if day68 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The storage room. Just try not to pay any attention to any stains on the floor.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...okay?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The storage room is fine. Just make sure you don’t leave any of them out again. The staff got pissed off that we didn’t do a great job last time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mhm! I’ll make sure to get everything this time. Don’t you worry, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Before you go, though- there's something I've been meaning to ask you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux4.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is? What is it?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...it's less of a question and more of a demand.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, if you want a hug that badly, all you have to do is ask.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't need a hug, I need you to do me a favor.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hugs can be favors too, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami, I don't want a hug.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think you do, but sure. Go on with your non-hug related favor.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's about the cooking competition thing with Ayane.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You mean about how I’m going to beat her so badly that she’ll stop cooking for the rest of her life?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, no. But I admire the confidence.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course I’m confident. I know everything you like. I’ve trained my whole life for this.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not gonna lose just cause Ayane wants to raise an army of children with you.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s great. But what I'm referring to is the imbalance in terms of judges.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...you're the only judge, aren't you?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. Sana is coming as well and she'll be serving as a secondary judge.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux5.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Since when? Why hasn't anyone told me about this?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I may have...forgotten to mention it. But it's happening.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Won’t she be biased, though? Her and Ayane are really close.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right. But I’m biased toward you since I eat your food literally every day.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux6.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...what should we do?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Obviously, we need to call in a third judge.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux7.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A third judge...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, umm...I guess I could see if Maya wants to come over?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Great. That’s exactly who I had in mind.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux8.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that why you don't want to hug me? Because your mind is fully consumed by Maya?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I say yes, will you still make me dinner every night?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will. But I can't guarantee there won't be poison in it.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Harsh.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, is the favor complete? Can I go back to cleaning now?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, you may proceed. And thanks for being so understanding, Ami.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux9.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Any time. I'll wind up winning no matter how many judges we have, so I'm not worried at all.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don't feel pressured to wait up for me if I take too long, Sensei! I've gotta shower after this anyway.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene weightlimitredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/weightlimitredux1.webp",
      "alt": "weightlimitredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ami runs off and images of the forbidden territory known as the girls' shower room consumes my mind and prevents me from cleaning at all for the rest of the period.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "As I sit with my hands still caked in the dried blood of a custodial worker, I think of a land where breasts roam free.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A land where no harm befalls anyone...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The closest thing to Heaven this earth can offer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And I am stuck out here...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Meanwhile...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump showersx",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label showersx:",
      "zh": ""
