    },
    {
      "en": ": Do...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you...need something, Yumi?...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showers2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showers2.webp",
      "alt": "showers2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry, lardass. Shower’s got a weight limit. I'm sure you understand.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Think you’re gonna have to wait here until everyone else is done. Don't want the floors collapsing and all that shit.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
