      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showers3.webp",
      "alt": "showers3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do we...have to do this in here?...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I did something to offend you, I'm sorry...I just...really want to take a shower and-",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showers4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showers4.webp",
      "alt": "showers4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You really think I'd be offended by something you did? Who the fuck do you think you are?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, better question- who the fuck do you think I am? You ain't shit to me.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So tell me fatass, why would I ever be offended by something you say? Go on. Tell me to my face.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showers5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showers5.webp",
      "alt": "showers5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't have anything to tell you at all! I really do just want to take a shower!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Already told you, there's a limit to how much this floor can take. Gonna have to wait your turn.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you please just let me pass? I...won't even look at you if that will make you happy...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You sayin' you normally look at me, you fucking dyke? And here I was thinking your roommate was the only muffdiver we had in our class.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yumi...please!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showers6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showers6.webp",
      "alt": "showers6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You wanna pass? Fine. I guess I can look the other way.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I've got a condition, though.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A...condition?...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": W-What do you want?...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
