    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wallet?...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You saying I'm fuckin' poor, lardass? You think you're better than me?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, I just-",
