      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, I offer you a deal as simple as that and you've gotta fucking think about it?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What's the problem? You embarrassed about walkin' across the room naked? We're all girls, ain't we? We've all seen each other's tits before.",
